<section class="py-20 bg-zinc-950 border-t border-white/5 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Gradual Natural Progression</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
        Results Over <span class="gold-gradient-text">Time</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Because BlackRoots uses natural botanicals rather than synthetic harsh dyes, color buildup is natural and root-strengthening happens progressively.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8">
      
      <!-- Week 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-amber-500/20 text-center relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Week 2
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Scalp Detox & Dandruff Elimination</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Scalp feel purer, itchiness disappears, and early hair fall reduction is noticed as Activated Charcoal and Amla start purifying pores.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Week 4 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-amber-500/30 text-center relative overflow-hidden group shadow-lg">
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-black text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Week 4
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Grey Tones Subdued</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          White/grey hair starts absorbing natural Japanese Indigo tones, blending smoothly into deeper brownish-black shades with renewed shine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Week 8 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-emerald-500/30 text-center relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Week 8+
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Full Natural Dark Lustre</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Hair locks in rich natural dark black tones, roots are significantly stronger with healthy density and silky softness.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-[11px] text-gray-500 italic max-w-xl mx-auto m-0">
      *Note: Timeline and degree of darkening are illustrative representations. Individual results may vary depending on individual hair texture, grey percentage, and regular wash routine.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Results Timeline",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
